Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Experimental RK3588S PWM6_M1 WS2812 controller
 Controls an 18-pixel WS2812 strip from PWM6_M1 on the RoboParty RK3588S
 board. Provides solid, flash, chase, rainbow, and demo effects.
